            subtitle: 'Card game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Xiangyang Mahjong is a Hubei regional Mahjong variant associated with Xiangyang play communities. It keeps the familiar Mahjong draw-discard structure with meld claims and a complete-hand win condition, while the table profile defines specific scoring and validity conventions.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Xiangyang Mahjong developed as a regional table profile within Chinese Mahjong traditions through repeated community play in Hubei.',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
